{"node_id": "TIT10AN_DIV1ANCO_CH10.04GEPR_10.04.070DEJUNFTI10", "heading": "10.04.070 - Department Jurisdiction—Enforcement of Title 10.", "toc_heading": "10.04.070 - Department Jurisdiction—Enforcement of Title 10.", "path": ["Code of Ordinances", "Title 10 - ANIMALS", "Division 1 - ANIMAL CONTROL", "Chapter 10.04 - GENERAL PROVISIONS*", "10.04.070 - Department Jurisdiction—Enforcement of Title 10."], "text": "Title 10 of the Los Angeles County Code is enforced in all unincorporated areas of the County\nof Los Angeles. Title 10, or portions of Title 10, will be enforced in contract cities as applicable.\n\n(Ord. 2016-0040 § 9, 2016.)", "html": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"runin\">\n               <a href=\"\" data-chunk-id=\"TIT10AN\" class=\"section-link\" data-product-id=\"16274\">Title 10</a> of the Los Angeles County Code is enforced in all unincorporated areas of the County\n               of Los Angeles. <a href=\"\" data-chunk-id=\"TIT10AN\" class=\"section-link\" data-product-id=\"16274\">Title 10</a>, or portions of <a href=\"\" data-chunk-id=\"TIT10AN\" class=\"section-link\" data-product-id=\"16274\">Title 10</a>, will be enforced in contract cities as applicable.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. 2016-0040 § 9, 2016.)\n               </p></div>", "tables": [], "links": [{"href": "", "attributes": {"href": "", "data-chunk-id": "TIT10AN", "class": "section-link", "data-product-id": "16274"}, "target_node_id": "TIT10AN", "link_type": null, "text": "Title 10"}, {"href": "", "attributes": {"href": "", "data-chunk-id": "TIT10AN", "class": "section-link", "data-product-id": "16274"}, "target_node_id": "TIT10AN", "link_type": null, "text": "Title 10"}, {"href": "", "attributes": {"href": "", "data-chunk-id": "TIT10AN", "class": "section-link", "data-product-id": "16274"}, "target_node_id": "TIT10AN", "link_type": null, "text": "Title 10"}], "list_count": 0, "footnotes": null, "notes": []